2026-05-09 16:29:28,612 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:29:28,612 - INFO - That said, your friend isn't wrong either from a strict definitional standpoint. If a sandwich is "filling between two pieces of bread," then technically a hot dog fits that description. By that pure structural logic, it would be a sandwich.
