2026-05-09 16:32:32,934 - INFO - The luck component is humbling and true—but it's also somewhat paralyzing if it becomes an excuse. Your friend's emphasis on hard work is probably more motivating and useful as a life philosophy, even if it's not the complete picture.
2026-05-09 16:32:32,934 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:32:32,934 - INFO - Maybe the real insight you both could agree on is: **Do what you can control (hard work), stay humble about what you can't (luck), and you'll be in the best position possible.**
