2026-05-09 16:50:03,836 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:50:03,837 - INFO - Also, today's young adults face genuinely *different* challenges (social media, economic pressures, climate anxiety) rather than simply lacking resilience. More protection in some domains doesn't necessarily mean they're "ill-equipped"—they're adapting to different conditions.
