2026-05-09 16:51:04,746 - INFO - - Overmedicalization is a genuine problem. Some normal sadness, grief, or stress responses do get labeled as disorders requiring pills.
2026-05-09 16:51:04,746 - INFO - - Social/economic factors (poverty, isolation, inequality, work conditions) absolutely matter for mental health and are sometimes underemphasized in clinical settings.
2026-05-09 16:51:04,746 - INFO - - Pharmaceutical companies have incentives that don't always align with patient wellbeing.
