2026-05-09 16:52:15,168 - INFO - 
2026-05-09 16:52:15,168 - INFO - That said, the concern isn't baseless. In-person proximity *does* create certain things more naturally—spontaneous conversations, easier onboarding, some forms of serendipitous collaboration. Those are real losses worth acknowledging.
